{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back over 2,000 years and walk in the footsteps of Jesus Christ \u2014 from His baptism to the resurrection. Inspired by the New Testament, <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> offers a unique spiritual simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to resist temptation in the desert, heal the sick, and uplift those in need? Perform over 30 meaningful miracles \u2014 from feeding the 5,000 and healing lepers to calming the storm and restoring sight to the blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e3746e2059aa65239596249d1ad9c318.mp4?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deepen your connection with the Holy Spirit through prayer, as new gameplay mechanics blend with timeless biblical stories. <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> seeks to share the Gospel in an engaging and respectful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/d5f1667cc47e0176f82a0b7f143e62a5.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over 10 hours of immersive gameplay through deserts, waters, and mountains \u2014 leading to the profound story of Christ\u2019s crucifixion and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His birth to the crucifixion and resurrection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and the Galilee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Perform over 30 powerful miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be guided by the Holy Spirit, and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Meet over 60 story-driven characters, including the disciples of Christ. Reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1198970?t=1766671177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766671177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/8d5b124893319ec7f8d06eb119f4147dfee2624b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766671177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/8d5b124893319ec7f8d06eb119f4147dfee2624b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766671177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2007580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back over 2,000 years and walk in the footsteps of Jesus Christ \u2014 from His baptism to the resurrection. Inspired by the New Testament, <i>I Am Jesus Christ</i> offers a unique spiritual simulation experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/e021064866320bb0adc2fbade43742dd.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.ak