ains \u2014 leading to the profound story of Christ\u2019s crucifixion and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/840659096fd16d36750cbdb908a3b8b5.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His birth to the crucifixion and resurrection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and the Galilee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Perform over 30 powerful miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Be guided by the Holy Spirit, and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Meet over 60 story-driven characters, including the disciples of Christ. Reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.poster.avif?t=1766671177\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/5d5b1fcbccaed68e9d1256e14b588736.webm?t=1766671177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Space Boat Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description"