1198970/ss_c12ad6d515dd1fbbd34155a8b781c54e5e5d3735.600x338.jpg?t=1766671177"}],"short_description":"Walk in the footsteps of Jesus in this immersive first-person retelling of His life \u2014 from birth to resurrection. Perform powerful miracles, meet biblical figures, and explore the Holy Land from Jerusalem to the Galilee. Become the Messiah in I Am Jesus Christ.","steam_appid":1198970,"support_info":{"email":"contact@spaceboatstudios.com","url":"spaceboatstudios.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}